4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.6 28.6 36.7 36.7 54.0 60.7 69.0 69.0 75.7 83.3 83.3 99.0 99.0 105.7 112.6 112.6 130.6 130.6 138.7 145.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 16.6 60.7 75.7 105.7 119.3 119.3 138.7 145.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » bu ma'nâda merviydir. Sûrei Tahrîme de bak. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"248\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 248.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 42.7 50.3 57.0 63.7 63.7 70.6 70.6 87.0 87.0 93.7 100.6 100.6 116.3 116.3 123.0 131.3 138.0 138.0 144.7 151.6 168.7 175.6 184.6 191.3 198.0 198.0 204.7 211.6 223.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.7 57.0 93.7 123.0 131.3 151.6 175.6 191.3 204.7 211.6 223.6 231.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - Sûrei Meryeme bak. </p>"}